>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-CMD PIC X(8) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-TARGET PIC X(16) VALUE SPACES.
01 WS-COUNT PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-FAIL-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TRIP PIC 9 COMP-5 VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-OP PIC X(16).
01 LK-TEXT PIC X(8192).
01 LK-TEXT-LEN PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
01 LK-A.
   05 LK-A-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LK-A-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LK-A-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LK-A-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-B.
   05 LK-B-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LK-B-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LK-B-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LK-B-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-OUT.
   05 LK-OUT-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LK-OUT-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LK-OUT-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LK-OUT-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-REM.
   05 LK-REM-SIGN PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
   05 LK-REM-CHUNKS PIC 9(18) COMP-5.
   05 LK-REM-HEAD USAGE POINTER.
   05 LK-REM-TAIL USAGE POINTER.
01 LK-CMP PIC S9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING
    LK-OP LK-TEXT LK-TEXT-LEN
    LK-A LK-B LK-OUT LK-REM LK-CMP LK-STATUS.
MAIN.
    MOVE 0 TO LK-STATUS LK-CMP
    MOVE "CHECK" TO WS-CMD
    MOVE LK-OP TO WS-TARGET
    MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNT WS-FAIL-STATUS WS-TRIP
    CALL "QA51B-FAULT-CONTROL" USING
        WS-CMD WS-TARGET WS-COUNT WS-FAIL-STATUS WS-TRIP
    IF WS-TRIP = 1
        MOVE WS-FAIL-STATUS TO LK-STATUS
        GOBACK
    END-IF
    CALL "BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE-REAL" USING
        LK-OP LK-TEXT LK-TEXT-LEN
        LK-A LK-B LK-OUT LK-REM LK-CMP LK-STATUS
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM BIG-INTEGER-SERVICE.
